# `take` after `sort` keeps the first rows; `limit` is the same operator.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| sort by timestamp desc, orderId desc
| take 3
| limit 2
| project orderId, timestamp
---- expected
orderId | timestamp
string  | datetime
--------+---------------------
o-0050  | 2024-05-28T15:22:15Z
o-0049  | 2024-05-21T03:48:54Z
